WEBVTT

01:21.430 --> 01:26.850
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.539 --> 01:29.680
[Episode 30]

01:33.229 --> 01:34.030
We succeeded?

01:34.430 --> 01:35.280
Fourth Master,

01:35.280 --> 01:36.710
we did succeed.

01:37.590 --> 01:38.310
Great!

01:41.479 --> 01:42.509
Great!

01:43.310 --> 01:44.840
Do you know what this is called?

01:44.840 --> 01:46.680
It's called karma.

01:48.560 --> 01:50.300
My good third brother...

01:51.229 --> 01:52.200
He was cruel enough to ruin

01:52.200 --> 01:54.070
his own brother's future,

01:54.759 --> 01:55.789
so don't blame me

01:55.789 --> 01:58.039
for making him taste the agony

01:58.350 --> 02:00.070
of losing his true love.

02:01.180 --> 02:02.300
But Fourth Master,

02:02.640 --> 02:03.790
that Xie said

02:04.350 --> 02:05.680
they couldn't get out of the city.

02:05.680 --> 02:06.640
With no other choice,

02:06.640 --> 02:08.560
they can only hide in the capital for now.

02:08.560 --> 02:09.150
What?

02:09.960 --> 02:10.430
This...

02:12.030 --> 02:13.830
Wh-What else did he say?

02:14.430 --> 02:15.430
He just said...

02:16.800 --> 02:18.000
"Making him taste the agony

02:18.000 --> 02:19.400
of losing his true love"?

02:21.730 --> 02:23.200
Third Uncle's true love?

02:25.030 --> 02:28.290
Everyone who is supposed
to be in the mansion is still here.

02:29.060 --> 02:30.380
Could it be Gu Jinzhao?

02:31.870 --> 02:33.070
For the next two days,

02:33.150 --> 02:34.470
put everything else aside

02:34.470 --> 02:36.470
and keep a close eye on Fourth Uncle.

02:37.150 --> 02:37.680
No.

02:39.810 --> 02:41.230
He won't show up himself.

02:44.190 --> 02:45.540
Just keep an eye on Chen Zhong

02:45.540 --> 02:47.140
and see what his next move is.

02:52.030 --> 02:52.590
Hya!

02:53.310 --> 02:54.760
Mr. Jiang has sent a message.

02:54.760 --> 02:56.430
We've found traces of the criminals.

02:56.430 --> 02:58.690
It seems they headed toward the capital.

03:26.680 --> 03:27.310
You just

03:27.310 --> 03:28.520
locked her inside like this?

03:28.520 --> 03:29.560
With people coming and going,

03:29.560 --> 03:31.020
what if someone finds out?

03:31.430 --> 03:32.930
You don't understand.

03:33.079 --> 03:34.750
It's darkest under the lamp.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.050
Don't worry.

03:36.360 --> 03:37.310
Tomorrow morning,

03:37.310 --> 03:39.360
a human trafficker is coming to see her.

03:39.360 --> 03:40.820
Once she's in their hands,

03:41.150 --> 03:42.480
they have plenty of ways

03:42.750 --> 03:44.150
to erase her traces.

03:50.190 --> 03:50.800
Chen Yi!

03:51.030 --> 03:52.140
Take my calling card

03:52.140 --> 03:53.000
to the Five Wards Military Command

03:53.000 --> 03:54.240
and tell them I will arrive shortly.

03:54.240 --> 03:54.710
Also,

03:54.870 --> 03:55.590
return to the mansion to fetch my seal.

03:55.590 --> 03:56.030
Hurry!

03:56.030 --> 03:56.520
Yes!

03:57.710 --> 03:58.510
Third Master,

03:58.910 --> 03:59.630
are you going to...

03:59.630 --> 04:00.630
Lock down the city!

04:00.630 --> 04:02.080
Since they are in the city,

04:02.080 --> 04:04.010
lock down the capital completely!

04:04.560 --> 04:06.090
Close the gates and search!

04:11.000 --> 04:12.080
I'll take both.

04:12.910 --> 04:14.170
Forty taels of silver.

04:14.240 --> 04:15.500
Not a single coin more.

04:46.510 --> 04:47.240
Follow them.

04:53.430 --> 04:54.390
What are you doing?

04:54.390 --> 04:55.190
Let us go!

05:01.070 --> 05:01.800
Sir,

05:02.040 --> 05:03.560
give me some water.

05:03.880 --> 05:05.150
You talk too much.

05:26.390 --> 05:27.240
Don't eat it then.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.070
Sir, sir!

05:29.260 --> 05:31.120
This is really terrible.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.250
I can't eat it.

05:34.720 --> 05:35.580
How about this?

05:35.920 --> 05:36.630
Take this thing

05:36.630 --> 05:37.630
on my wrist.

05:48.159 --> 05:49.720
If you take this to a pawnshop,

05:49.720 --> 05:51.920
it's worth at least 100 taels of silver.

05:58.360 --> 06:00.830
Look. What's this?

06:08.300 --> 06:09.510
You're really impressive now!

06:09.510 --> 06:10.310
Of course I am.

06:11.850 --> 06:14.050
[Ji's Pawnshop]

06:18.120 --> 06:18.750
Hold on.

06:19.390 --> 06:20.230
Seize

06:20.270 --> 06:21.110
this woman!

06:21.260 --> 06:21.890
You...

06:22.800 --> 06:23.390
You...

06:23.600 --> 06:24.870
What are you doing?

06:26.410 --> 06:27.750
This pink pearl

06:27.830 --> 06:29.250
is from the West Sea.

06:29.590 --> 06:31.790
It's the only one in the entire capital.

06:31.950 --> 06:32.920
It's a dowry gift

06:32.920 --> 06:33.560
from our Old Madam

06:33.560 --> 06:34.720
to our Eldest Miss.

06:34.870 --> 06:35.510
Tell me!

06:36.040 --> 06:37.500
Why is it in your hands?

06:37.720 --> 06:38.240
I...

06:39.750 --> 06:42.070
I don't know!

06:44.830 --> 06:45.360
Madam,

06:45.720 --> 06:47.120
this is the Young Master.

06:47.240 --> 06:48.040
You may leave.

06:53.720 --> 06:55.050
I heard you want someone

06:55.310 --> 06:57.120
with good looks,

06:58.120 --> 06:59.950
who is literate,

07:00.310 --> 07:03.070
and comes from a good family.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.310
This kind of girl,

07:05.560 --> 07:06.720
I do have one.

07:07.920 --> 07:08.720
However,

07:09.310 --> 07:10.600
she's not cheap.

07:11.120 --> 07:12.050
Name your price.

07:15.390 --> 07:16.720
Two hundred taels it is.

07:17.240 --> 07:20.630
[50 taels]

07:20.650 --> 07:23.160
[Great Yan Bank
General Circulation Banknotes]

07:25.200 --> 07:26.700
Why is this only 150 taels?

07:31.270 --> 07:32.670
This jade pendant of mine

07:32.680 --> 07:34.630
is worth at least 50 taels.

07:36.720 --> 07:37.380
However...

07:38.900 --> 07:40.560
you have to let me see her first

07:40.920 --> 07:42.180
before I give it to you.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.530
You want to inspect the goods, huh?

07:44.560 --> 07:45.270
Alright.

07:45.870 --> 07:47.270
Then come with me.

07:56.310 --> 07:58.159
She is right inside.

08:01.520 --> 08:02.330
Let's go.

08:16.270 --> 08:17.160
Right now...

08:17.560 --> 08:19.290
they've already been drugged.

08:19.560 --> 08:21.120
It'll be easier for you

08:21.800 --> 08:23.360
to take them away later.

08:24.430 --> 08:26.000
The drug won't hurt.

08:57.630 --> 08:58.270
Move!

08:59.390 --> 09:00.660
Third Uncle's voice?

09:09.910 --> 09:10.630
Don't run!

09:34.150 --> 09:34.810
Don't move!

10:17.840 --> 10:18.840
It's alright now.

10:19.630 --> 10:21.490
-Third Master...
-It's alright.

10:22.550 --> 10:23.960
I was so scared!

10:24.720 --> 10:25.720
It's alright now.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.600
It's alright. It's alright.

10:34.630 --> 10:35.490
How do you feel?

10:36.960 --> 10:38.270
Third Master...

10:42.870 --> 10:44.720
Jinzhao? Jinzhao!

11:00.150 --> 11:00.870
Stop!

11:01.870 --> 11:02.670
Stop!

11:06.790 --> 11:07.760
Don't pull me!

11:11.510 --> 11:12.610
Get away!

11:12.640 --> 11:14.010
Go to hell!

11:14.630 --> 11:15.740
Go to hell!

11:37.910 --> 11:38.840
Young Master...

11:41.440 --> 11:42.770
She saw our faces.

11:44.260 --> 11:45.110
I know.

12:00.120 --> 12:00.940
Young Master,

12:01.270 --> 12:02.200
don't be afraid.

12:04.870 --> 12:06.200
I killed her.

12:08.120 --> 12:09.050
Don't be afraid.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.730
Don't be afraid, Young Master.

12:24.490 --> 12:26.380
Gu Jinzhao was taken away?

12:26.510 --> 12:27.220
Yes.

12:27.350 --> 12:28.750
In a moment of desperation, Lord Chen

12:28.750 --> 12:30.080
contacted the Five Wards Military Command

12:30.080 --> 12:31.720
and locked all the city gates.

12:31.720 --> 12:33.600
They claimed to be catching bandits

12:33.600 --> 12:34.940
and searched from house to house.

12:34.940 --> 12:36.690
In the end, they found them in a courtyard

12:36.690 --> 12:38.490
in the southern part of the city.

12:51.790 --> 12:53.960
Gu Jinzhao, is this the man you chose?

12:59.130 --> 12:59.700
You,

13:00.290 --> 13:01.310
take a few men

13:02.670 --> 13:03.960
and my warrant

13:04.790 --> 13:06.600
to the Five Wards Military Command

13:06.600 --> 13:07.910
and bring the villains
who kidnapped Gu Jinzhao

13:07.910 --> 13:09.000
to me.

13:10.120 --> 13:11.180
Tell them this case

13:11.510 --> 13:13.310
will be tried by Xuanfeng Guard.

13:13.830 --> 13:14.310
Yes.

13:17.750 --> 13:19.000
Bring out the prisoners

13:19.000 --> 13:19.870
caught yesterday.

13:19.870 --> 13:20.390
Yes.

13:23.750 --> 13:24.360
My Lord.

13:24.690 --> 13:25.820
No need to follow me.

13:30.850 --> 13:34.610
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

13:32.510 --> 13:34.720
Why aren't they back yet?

13:35.600 --> 13:36.150
Hupo.

13:36.670 --> 13:37.870
Go and check the door.

13:37.910 --> 13:38.440
Yes.

13:40.000 --> 13:40.600
Mother,

13:41.200 --> 13:41.960
why don't we go back

13:41.960 --> 13:43.440
inside and sit down to wait?

13:43.440 --> 13:44.200
Seriously,

13:44.960 --> 13:47.630
Yanyun's wife is too headstrong.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.550
When a newly married woman

13:49.550 --> 13:51.200
visits her natal family, she usually goes
to her father's side—

13:51.200 --> 13:52.150
yet she

13:52.600 --> 13:54.660
went to her mother's family instead.

13:54.840 --> 13:55.670
See?

13:56.150 --> 13:57.390
Now something has happened.

13:57.390 --> 13:59.360
Mother, please calm down.

13:59.960 --> 14:01.000
Yanyun's wife

14:01.000 --> 14:02.510
is indeed a bit willful.

14:03.150 --> 14:03.790
But

14:04.000 --> 14:04.750
she couldn't have known

14:04.750 --> 14:06.080
she would be kidnapped.

14:06.600 --> 14:08.480
Fortunately, she was rescued,

14:08.510 --> 14:09.240
right?

14:10.030 --> 14:11.030
It's just that...

14:11.360 --> 14:13.620
she was missing for a whole day and night.

14:13.670 --> 14:15.240
Who knows what happened?

14:17.200 --> 14:19.510
She is the wife
of a Grand Secretary, after all.

14:19.510 --> 14:20.440
In the future,

14:20.750 --> 14:23.110
there will definitely be plenty of gossip.

14:23.110 --> 14:25.600
That's exactly what I'm afraid of.

14:25.790 --> 14:27.320
If people gossip about her,

14:28.750 --> 14:30.750
it will also drag our Yanyun down.

14:31.480 --> 14:32.440
Seriously!

14:42.750 --> 14:43.240
Master.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.430
How was it?

14:44.790 --> 14:45.990
They were all caught.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.150
I took a shortcut

14:47.150 --> 14:48.790
to come back and bring you the news.

14:48.790 --> 14:49.440
Master,

14:49.670 --> 14:51.240
before Third Master traces it back to us,

14:51.240 --> 14:52.340
let's run.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.900
If we don't run now,

14:54.550 --> 14:55.510
it'll be too late.

14:55.510 --> 14:56.150
It's over.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.700
We are totally doomed.

14:59.440 --> 15:00.240
They're here!

15:00.390 --> 15:01.360
They're here!

15:04.440 --> 15:05.000
Master.

15:06.240 --> 15:07.080
Jinzhao is back.

15:07.080 --> 15:08.140
Let's go there too.

15:09.870 --> 15:10.720
You go.

15:11.080 --> 15:11.630
I...

15:12.360 --> 15:13.690
I need to go out.

15:13.870 --> 15:15.120
Go out? To where?

15:15.750 --> 15:17.150
Chen Zhong just sent word

15:17.240 --> 15:18.030
that the
Southern Metropolitan Administration

15:18.030 --> 15:20.200
will issue 2 million
extra salt certificates next month.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.800
I must go there immediately.

15:21.840 --> 15:23.750
Chen Zhong, get the carriage ready.

15:23.750 --> 15:24.880
Yes, Fourth Master.

15:27.120 --> 15:27.630
Wait.

15:27.750 --> 15:28.970
Is it that urgent?

15:29.080 --> 15:31.010
Can't you leave tomorrow morning?

15:31.080 --> 15:32.030
What do you know?

15:49.510 --> 15:50.270
Mother...

15:50.440 --> 15:50.910
Well...

15:51.270 --> 15:51.750
It's...

15:53.790 --> 15:54.960
You'd better put me down.

15:54.960 --> 15:56.090
I'll walk by myself.

15:57.000 --> 15:57.670
Mother,

15:58.440 --> 15:59.870
Jinzhao just got a fright

15:59.870 --> 16:01.000
and sprained her ankle.

16:01.000 --> 16:03.000
I'll take her back to her room first.

16:04.150 --> 16:05.210
Go back to her room.

16:10.720 --> 16:11.390
Yunting.

16:12.840 --> 16:13.640
Young Master,

16:14.080 --> 16:15.240
don't you think

16:16.840 --> 16:18.000
I look like a joke?

16:26.120 --> 16:27.850
How could there be such a thing?

16:28.320 --> 16:29.550
Shameless.

16:30.150 --> 16:30.870
Mother,

16:31.510 --> 16:32.440
Yanyun

16:32.960 --> 16:34.630
is obviously doing this on purpose.

16:34.630 --> 16:35.670
On purpose?

16:36.600 --> 16:38.080
This is our home.

16:38.310 --> 16:40.370
Is there a need to play so many tricks?

16:40.390 --> 16:41.320
Seriously.

16:42.400 --> 16:44.450
A good man has been led astray.

16:48.150 --> 16:49.680
As for what happened today,

16:49.910 --> 16:52.670
no one is allowed to mention it
in the future.

16:53.120 --> 16:53.840
Yes.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.840
If anyone

16:57.240 --> 16:58.720
dares to gossip

16:59.600 --> 17:00.800
and I hear about it,

17:01.550 --> 17:02.810
there will be no trial—

17:02.910 --> 17:05.109
they will be beaten to death on the spot.

17:05.349 --> 17:06.510
-Yes.
-Yes.

17:06.920 --> 17:07.980
It's getting late.

17:08.480 --> 17:09.609
Everyone, dismiss.

17:21.160 --> 17:22.220
Just sit, alright?

17:24.310 --> 17:26.240
Let me help you take off your shoes.

17:30.110 --> 17:30.970
How do you feel?

17:31.550 --> 17:32.720
You suffered a lot.

17:33.200 --> 17:34.920
You were abducted this time,

17:35.750 --> 17:37.790
so it's inevitable
that people will gossip.

17:37.790 --> 17:39.390
By carrying you in like this,

17:40.310 --> 17:42.240
if there are still any blind fools,

17:42.550 --> 17:43.350
then don't blame me

17:43.350 --> 17:44.680
for not warning them.

17:44.750 --> 17:45.550
Third Master.

17:52.070 --> 17:53.200
I'll be right back.

17:57.590 --> 17:58.240
My Lady,

17:58.720 --> 18:00.180
let me serve you your bath.

18:01.290 --> 18:02.720
Ms. Zhao can do it.

18:03.510 --> 18:05.240
You should go back and rest now.

18:05.270 --> 18:06.870
If you feel unwell anywhere,

18:06.920 --> 18:07.720
just tell me.

18:07.720 --> 18:08.520
It's alright.

18:09.070 --> 18:09.920
I'm fine.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.370
Just listen to Her Ladyship.

18:14.370 --> 18:15.270
Go back and rest.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.160
I'm here.

18:16.400 --> 18:17.440
It's fine, Ms. Zhao.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.640
Let's do it together.

18:26.720 --> 18:28.780
I have some urgent matters to handle.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.510
Let them serve you your bath.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.810
Get a good sleep.

18:32.240 --> 18:33.370
Don't wait up for me.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.400
I'll be right back, okay?

18:43.920 --> 18:44.980
I'll be right back.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.570
Take good care of Madam.

18:48.720 --> 18:49.240
Yes.

19:00.350 --> 19:01.720
I clearly warned you,

19:02.310 --> 19:04.170
but you did it time and time again.

19:05.110 --> 19:05.720
And this time,

19:05.720 --> 19:07.200
you even dared
to target your sister-in-law.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.620
Because I held a grudge!

19:10.000 --> 19:11.330
Because I held a grudge!

19:13.680 --> 19:14.510
Why?

19:15.070 --> 19:15.880
Why?

19:15.880 --> 19:17.940
Just because I killed Fifth Brother?

19:19.200 --> 19:20.610
But I didn't know anything back then!

19:20.610 --> 19:21.880
I knew nothing!

19:22.310 --> 19:23.510
You are my brother.

19:23.510 --> 19:24.440
You could have taught me!

19:24.440 --> 19:26.480
Why did you ruin my future?

19:27.550 --> 19:29.000
I also studied hard for 10 years.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.490
But now I can only handle trivial matters!

19:30.490 --> 19:32.820
Do you know how much
I've held this grudge?

19:35.110 --> 19:35.720
So you know that

19:35.720 --> 19:37.180
you killed Fifth Brother?

19:37.440 --> 19:38.640
You deserve it!

19:39.200 --> 19:40.510
I deserve it.

19:40.550 --> 19:41.880
I deserve it!

19:43.400 --> 19:46.030
Chen Yanyun, I deserve it!

19:47.350 --> 19:48.000
No!

19:50.060 --> 19:51.830
It's because you are jealous of me.

19:51.830 --> 19:52.400
You are jealous

19:52.400 --> 19:54.800
that Mother only liked me since childhood.

19:55.160 --> 19:57.270
So you ruined my whole life!

19:58.400 --> 20:00.200
I won't let you off easy too!

20:01.350 --> 20:03.600
I want you to taste my pain!

20:03.720 --> 20:05.670
A pain worse than death!

20:07.270 --> 20:07.880
I know.

20:07.880 --> 20:09.510
By the way you looked at that woman,

20:09.510 --> 20:10.070
I knew

20:10.070 --> 20:11.780
she was your weak spot!

20:12.440 --> 20:14.440
I wanted something to happen to her.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.110
I wanted to kidnap her,

20:16.110 --> 20:17.310
sell her to a brothel,

20:17.310 --> 20:19.640
and let the world trample her!

20:33.450 --> 20:35.080
Given your numerous crimes,

20:35.400 --> 20:37.440
exiling you 3,000 miles away
is not excessive.

20:37.440 --> 20:39.570
Go to Shaanxi and find Second Brother.

20:40.070 --> 20:41.550
I've written him a letter

20:41.550 --> 20:43.280
about everything you've done.

20:43.510 --> 20:44.810
He will deal with you.

20:45.510 --> 20:47.240
Your son and wife are innocent.

20:47.640 --> 20:49.500
The family will take care of them.

20:51.160 --> 20:52.510
Chen Yanyun!

20:58.510 --> 20:59.640
Chen Yanyun!

21:20.240 --> 21:21.440
Go sleep in the study.

21:29.590 --> 21:30.520
Are you mad at me?

21:30.530 --> 21:31.350
I am.

21:32.370 --> 21:33.300
Leave right now.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.660
I don't want to see you.

21:36.000 --> 21:36.830
Don't talk to me.

21:36.830 --> 21:37.400
I'm going to sleep.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.330
I'm not leaving.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.000
If I leave,

21:41.790 --> 21:43.850
I'm afraid you won't let me come back.

21:44.160 --> 21:45.510
You are a Grand Secretary.

21:45.510 --> 21:46.750
Are you really afraid of that?

21:46.750 --> 21:47.430
Yes.

21:48.810 --> 21:51.220
This Grand Secretary is afraid of nothing,

21:51.510 --> 21:52.680
except for this.

21:53.270 --> 21:55.330
Where did you learn to talk like this?

21:55.590 --> 21:56.960
The Hall of Literary Profundity?

21:56.960 --> 21:58.160
I learned quite a lot.

22:03.030 --> 22:04.720
Alright, alright.

22:07.640 --> 22:09.030
I was wrong, okay?

22:11.790 --> 22:12.880
Just now,

22:13.830 --> 22:15.640
I sent Fourth Brother to Shaanxi.

22:15.640 --> 22:17.400
He probably won't be coming back.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.070
Why?

22:19.240 --> 22:20.550
The kidnappers who abducted you

22:20.550 --> 22:21.610
were bribed by him.

22:22.310 --> 22:23.440
To get revenge on me,

22:24.070 --> 22:25.470
he went to great lengths.

22:29.270 --> 22:30.640
Why did he do that?

22:32.960 --> 22:34.240
It's a long story.

22:35.070 --> 22:36.070
Do you remember

22:36.240 --> 22:37.240
that I have a

22:37.960 --> 22:39.690
fifth brother who passed away?

22:40.000 --> 22:42.440
He accidentally fell into the water
at the age of 6.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.310
But it was only years later

22:43.310 --> 22:43.960
that I found out

22:43.960 --> 22:45.590
he didn't fall accidentally.

22:45.590 --> 22:47.590
He was pushed by our fourth brother.

22:50.750 --> 22:51.510
Therefore,

22:51.920 --> 22:53.200
I ruined his imperial exam prospects

22:53.200 --> 22:55.070
and forbade him from taking it again.

22:55.070 --> 22:56.070
But at that time,

22:56.350 --> 22:58.400
he had already passed the provincial exam,

22:58.400 --> 22:59.800
so he hates me to the bone.

23:01.110 --> 23:01.830
If

23:02.070 --> 23:03.430
I had known he would

23:03.510 --> 23:05.040
take his revenge out on you,

23:06.270 --> 23:07.130
I would have...

23:08.750 --> 23:10.150
What would you have done?

23:10.160 --> 23:12.760
I would have done
something even more extreme.

23:13.680 --> 23:15.880
But he just disappeared all of a sudden.

23:16.230 --> 23:17.550
If Mother finds out,

23:17.720 --> 23:19.250
won't it be hard to explain?

23:23.200 --> 23:24.930
To the family, I'll just say...

23:25.040 --> 23:25.830
that Fourth Brother just went

23:25.830 --> 23:27.350
to Shaanxi for business.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.240
For the next few days,

23:30.240 --> 23:31.300
get some good rest.

23:32.920 --> 23:34.510
No need to pay respects to Mother.

23:34.510 --> 23:35.510
I'll just tell her

23:35.640 --> 23:37.110
that you're not feeling well.

23:37.110 --> 23:39.840
You're taking matters
into your own hands again.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.930
Linxia Restaurant will open soon.

23:41.960 --> 23:42.760
I was thinking

23:42.830 --> 23:44.890
of going over to take a look tomorrow.

23:46.720 --> 23:47.550
I know

23:48.000 --> 23:50.000
you're worried
that Mother and Sister-in-laws

23:50.000 --> 23:51.730
will ask me too many questions.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.790
But I have nothing to hide.

23:54.400 --> 23:56.600
Instead of hiding from certain things,

23:56.790 --> 23:57.640
it's better to

23:57.920 --> 23:59.070
face them openly.

24:02.920 --> 24:03.640
Okay.

24:06.550 --> 24:07.550
Tomorrow morning,

24:07.550 --> 24:08.200
I'll go with you

24:08.200 --> 24:09.660
to pay respects to Mother.

24:09.720 --> 24:11.270
I'll let her know in advance.

24:11.270 --> 24:12.000
Otherwise,

24:13.680 --> 24:14.920
she won't let you go out again.

24:14.920 --> 24:16.450
You absolutely must not go.

24:17.550 --> 24:18.400
It would seem like

24:18.400 --> 24:19.800
I'm using your authority

24:20.070 --> 24:21.640
to force her to agree.

24:22.000 --> 24:22.830
By then,

24:22.830 --> 24:24.690
even if she agrees on the surface,

24:24.720 --> 24:26.720
she will still blame me in her heart.

24:28.590 --> 24:29.720
I have my own ways.

24:33.030 --> 24:34.510
Alright, alright.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.140
Whatever my wife says.

24:37.480 --> 24:38.540
It's getting late.

24:39.590 --> 24:40.440
So now...

24:41.160 --> 24:42.490
let's go to sleep, okay?

24:44.830 --> 24:45.270
Come.

24:56.200 --> 24:57.640
This Yanwen.

24:57.540 --> 25:01.120
[Virtue Through the Ages]

24:58.310 --> 24:59.940
He just left without a word.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.510
What kind of business is it?

25:01.510 --> 25:02.680
It's so far away,

25:02.680 --> 25:04.880
and he didn't even take anyone with him.

25:05.030 --> 25:07.200
I offered to go with him
to take care of him.

25:07.200 --> 25:08.120
But he refused,

25:08.270 --> 25:09.030
saying that this time

25:09.030 --> 25:10.550
he had to go to Yulin Pass,

25:10.790 --> 25:12.160
which would be too exhausting.

25:12.160 --> 25:13.300
Yanwen

25:13.350 --> 25:15.040
must have learned from Yanyun

25:15.350 --> 25:16.930
to dote on his wife.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.270
Yanyun

25:20.400 --> 25:22.310
dotes on his wife a bit too much.

25:23.830 --> 25:24.960
Third Madam is here.

25:32.000 --> 25:33.160
Greetings, Mother.

25:34.510 --> 25:35.240
Take a seat.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.640
Have you recovered?

25:38.070 --> 25:39.790
Thank you for your concern, Mother.

25:39.790 --> 25:40.960
I am fine now.

25:47.270 --> 25:48.240
Where is Yanyun?

25:48.510 --> 25:49.440
Early this morning,

25:49.440 --> 25:51.840
he went to
the Hall of Literary Profundity.

25:52.350 --> 25:54.070
So he went back
to the Hall of Literary Profundity

25:54.070 --> 25:55.160
to handle affairs?

25:55.960 --> 25:56.550
Yes.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.030
Well...

25:59.030 --> 26:00.510
this is great news.

26:01.200 --> 26:02.110
Since Yanyun

26:02.270 --> 26:04.880
has regained his position
as a Grand Secretary,

26:04.880 --> 26:06.680
as the wife of a Grand Secretary,

26:07.550 --> 26:09.000
inside and out,

26:09.640 --> 26:11.510
you must act with proper decorum.

26:13.160 --> 26:13.790
Yes.

26:15.030 --> 26:16.090
By the way, Mother.

26:21.590 --> 26:23.000
Linxia Restaurant under my name

26:23.000 --> 26:24.330
is preparing to reopen.

26:24.590 --> 26:25.880
So I had the chefs

26:26.000 --> 26:26.640
make some

26:26.640 --> 26:28.180
pastries in new styles.

26:28.590 --> 26:29.510
This morning,

26:29.590 --> 26:31.680
I ordered them to make and send them here.

26:31.680 --> 26:32.510
I hope you

26:32.640 --> 26:33.510
and Xianlan

26:33.790 --> 26:35.680
can let everyone try them.

26:37.400 --> 26:39.200
Jinzhao, you are so thoughtful.

26:39.270 --> 26:41.030
The pastries from Linxia Restaurant

26:41.030 --> 26:42.160
are naturally good.

26:42.680 --> 26:43.750
However,

26:43.960 --> 26:45.490
you can just give them to us.

26:46.000 --> 26:47.060
Mother

26:47.160 --> 26:48.750
never eats sweets.

26:50.680 --> 26:52.010
Xianlan, you're right.

26:52.310 --> 26:53.370
My grandmother

26:53.510 --> 26:54.920
has already reminded me

26:55.270 --> 26:57.110
that Mother has diabetes

26:57.270 --> 26:58.730
and shouldn't eat sweets.

26:59.090 --> 27:00.200
So these pastries

27:00.310 --> 27:02.110
were made separately.

27:02.590 --> 27:04.850
I had a separate portion made for Mother.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.750
And there's no sugar in it.

27:07.110 --> 27:09.190
Only licorice and dates

27:09.310 --> 27:10.240
were used for flavor.

27:10.240 --> 27:11.240
I also asked

27:11.350 --> 27:12.680
your regular physician

27:12.750 --> 27:13.550
to check them.

27:13.920 --> 27:15.550
He said you can eat them.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.730
That's why I brought them here.

27:19.240 --> 27:21.840
It's nice of your grandmother
to care about me.

27:23.590 --> 27:25.590
Since it was so carefully prepared,

27:25.960 --> 27:27.400
I must taste it.

27:33.400 --> 27:34.030
Not bad.

27:34.850 --> 27:36.260
I'm glad you like it.

27:37.070 --> 27:39.440
I have a presumptuous request.

27:40.440 --> 27:42.050
My Linxia Restaurant

27:42.110 --> 27:43.750
is still short of hands.

27:44.270 --> 27:46.190
I heard your maiden family

27:46.310 --> 27:47.170
is a large clan.

27:47.510 --> 27:50.110
If you could recommend a few people to me,

27:50.640 --> 27:52.390
it would be a great help.

27:52.510 --> 27:54.000
I see.

27:56.750 --> 27:58.370
Mother, rest assured.

27:58.830 --> 28:00.680
Since they are recommended by you,

28:00.680 --> 28:01.540
I will make sure

28:01.550 --> 28:03.510
they are well compensated.

28:05.030 --> 28:06.030
Alright.

28:06.640 --> 28:08.970
I'll write to my maternal family tomorrow

28:10.070 --> 28:11.370
-This Third Sister-in-law
-to ask

28:11.370 --> 28:13.070
-is quite something.
-if anyone

28:13.070 --> 28:14.190
-She knows that Mother has always
-can come

28:14.190 --> 28:15.750
-cared about her maternal family.
-to help you.

28:15.750 --> 28:17.110
She actually used this method

28:17.110 --> 28:18.280
to please Mother.

28:18.590 --> 28:19.750
Jinzhao...

28:19.750 --> 28:20.680
She was kidnapped
when visiting her maternal family.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.640
-It's such a big deal.
-Since

28:21.640 --> 28:23.960
-you're busy with your business,
-And she just let it go?

28:23.960 --> 28:26.440
you are excused from

28:26.830 --> 28:28.270
your daily morning and evening greetings.

28:28.270 --> 28:28.960
Yes.

28:30.600 --> 28:32.600
Since Jinzhao's Linxia Restaurant

28:32.750 --> 28:35.080
will only serve female guests from now on,

28:35.350 --> 28:36.750
I suppose

28:36.920 --> 28:38.300
the wives of the Grand Secretaries

28:38.300 --> 28:40.160
will be regular customers there.

28:40.640 --> 28:42.510
The madams
of the Hall of Literary Profundity

28:42.510 --> 28:43.680
hold a tea party

28:43.680 --> 28:45.080
on the 7th of every month.

28:45.480 --> 28:46.830
Now, Jinzhao,

28:46.830 --> 28:48.160
you're one of them,

28:48.550 --> 28:50.610
and the day after tomorrow is the 7th.

28:51.510 --> 28:52.830
Have you

28:53.110 --> 28:54.970
already received an invitation?

28:56.400 --> 28:58.790
I have never heard of this tea party.

29:01.350 --> 29:03.640
It's normal that you didn't receive one.

29:04.070 --> 29:05.800
After all, you are still young.

29:05.830 --> 29:08.160
Those madams are older than you

29:08.720 --> 29:10.510
and come from noble families.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.920
Naturally, they have nothing in common

29:12.920 --> 29:14.680
to talk about with you.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.270
Right.

29:24.880 --> 29:25.590
Old Madam,

29:26.040 --> 29:26.800
Third Madam.

29:28.350 --> 29:29.400
Prime Minister Wang's residence

29:29.400 --> 29:30.830
just sent an invitation,

29:31.400 --> 29:32.650
inviting Third Madam

29:32.830 --> 29:35.630
to their residence for tea
the day after tomorrow.

29:37.750 --> 29:38.480
Got it.

29:48.700 --> 29:53.630
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

29:54.110 --> 29:55.170
How is your injury?

29:59.070 --> 29:59.880
I'm fine now.

30:00.590 --> 30:01.750
Have they caught the mastermind

30:01.750 --> 30:02.810
who kidnapped you?

30:04.110 --> 30:05.270
Third Master is still investigating.

30:05.270 --> 30:06.730
I didn't ask much about it.

30:08.590 --> 30:10.200
It was really a stroke of luck this time.

30:10.200 --> 30:12.060
If Third Uncle had been any later,

30:13.200 --> 30:14.000
you might have

30:14.480 --> 30:15.510
been killed.

30:18.410 --> 30:19.670
I really didn't expect

30:19.930 --> 30:22.390
that you would choose
to marry him in the end.

30:23.200 --> 30:25.660
Is it because of
his high position and power?

30:26.550 --> 30:27.550
But in my heart,

30:28.480 --> 30:30.400
you shouldn't be that kind of person.

30:30.400 --> 30:32.240
I don't know what you're talking about.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.200
I have something to do,

30:33.200 --> 30:34.330
so I'll leave first.

30:34.940 --> 30:35.750
Are you so unwilling

30:35.750 --> 30:36.480
to talk to me?

30:40.240 --> 30:41.720
What are you talking about?

30:41.720 --> 30:43.250
I'm just in a hurry to go out.

30:43.790 --> 30:44.390
By the way,

30:45.400 --> 30:47.030
since I'm married to Third Master,

30:47.030 --> 30:48.690
you should call me Third Aunt.

31:00.790 --> 31:01.200
You...

31:04.310 --> 31:04.960
Sorry.

31:06.160 --> 31:07.820
I accidentally stepped on it.

31:09.750 --> 31:10.400
Forget it.

31:10.750 --> 31:12.080
I don't want it anymore.

31:14.530 --> 31:19.570
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

31:26.200 --> 31:27.000
Young Master,

31:27.240 --> 31:28.070
let's go back.

31:29.510 --> 31:30.110
Tomorrow,

31:30.710 --> 31:31.780
take this earring

31:32.110 --> 31:33.040
to a jewelry shop

31:34.110 --> 31:36.170
and ask them to make an identical pair

31:36.270 --> 31:37.400
to give to Gu Jinzhao.

31:37.400 --> 31:38.200
Young Master,

31:38.270 --> 31:39.550
we can't do this.

31:40.350 --> 31:41.300
We can't...

31:41.790 --> 31:43.070
make any more mistakes.

31:43.070 --> 31:44.160
Just go.

31:45.790 --> 31:46.630
For her,

31:46.920 --> 31:47.920
I have already...

31:56.350 --> 31:57.510
Why does she still

31:57.510 --> 31:59.040
act like nothing happened?

32:01.830 --> 32:03.550
So there is such a tea party.

32:05.550 --> 32:06.160
What?

32:06.440 --> 32:07.240
You want to go?

32:07.920 --> 32:09.180
You don't want me to go?

32:09.310 --> 32:10.220
Of course I do.

32:11.110 --> 32:12.570
I'm afraid the Wang family

32:13.310 --> 32:14.710
might play tricks on you.

32:15.790 --> 32:17.720
Does it have to do with the scholars

32:17.720 --> 32:18.680
blocking the road last time?

32:18.680 --> 32:19.240
Yes.

32:20.610 --> 32:21.780
What is wrong

32:21.920 --> 32:22.980
with Wang Xuanfan?

32:23.160 --> 32:24.810
During the relief grain case last time,

32:24.810 --> 32:25.440
he deliberately

32:25.440 --> 32:26.510
framed you

32:26.750 --> 32:28.080
and got you imprisoned.

32:28.440 --> 32:30.400
Why is he doing this again?

32:31.880 --> 32:33.270
After that incident,

32:33.590 --> 32:34.750
I told my mentor

32:35.000 --> 32:37.600
that if we want land reform
across the country,

32:38.000 --> 32:39.780
we must start with ourselves.

32:40.030 --> 32:41.090
Grand Secretaries

32:41.310 --> 32:43.200
must take the initiative
to audit their own families

32:43.200 --> 32:44.640
and clear their own taxes,

32:44.640 --> 32:45.270
so they have the justification

32:45.270 --> 32:46.750
to audit lower-ranking officials.

32:46.750 --> 32:47.640
And lower-ranking officials

32:47.640 --> 32:49.000
must clear their own taxes

32:49.000 --> 32:51.530
before they can audit
the gentry and the rich.

32:51.920 --> 32:53.050
So my mentor ordered

32:53.310 --> 32:55.000
officials of the third-rank and above

32:55.000 --> 32:57.240
to self-inspect
and proactively return ill-gotten gains.

32:57.240 --> 32:58.680
Wang Xuanfan is a famous landlord

32:58.680 --> 32:59.880
in Daming Prefecture.

32:59.880 --> 33:00.920
He had to cough up

33:00.920 --> 33:03.380
tens of thousands of taels of silver
at once.

33:06.350 --> 33:07.200
No wonder.

33:07.310 --> 33:09.830
Cutting off someone's wealth
is like killing their parents.

33:09.830 --> 33:11.090
No wonder he hates you.

33:13.510 --> 33:14.400
So

33:15.110 --> 33:16.330
he came up with an idea

33:16.640 --> 33:18.510
to incite the scholars
to make trouble for me.

33:18.510 --> 33:20.040
Regardless of the outcome,

33:20.310 --> 33:21.640
he wanted to pin the blame

33:21.640 --> 33:22.840
of unfair land reform

33:23.270 --> 33:24.400
on me.

33:25.590 --> 33:28.160
A blemish
is what a Grand Secretary fears most.

33:28.160 --> 33:29.560
With a blemish like this,

33:29.790 --> 33:31.410
if someone holds on to it,

33:31.550 --> 33:32.550
it's very likely

33:33.310 --> 33:35.110
I'll be discharged in disgrace.

33:38.510 --> 33:39.640
I see.

33:50.680 --> 33:52.480
The invitation
has been sent to the Chen Mansion.

33:52.480 --> 33:53.330
Madam Chen said

33:53.330 --> 33:54.790
she will definitely come.

33:55.720 --> 33:56.850
Which Chen Mansion?

33:57.680 --> 33:58.680
Third Mr. Chen's?

34:01.440 --> 34:03.400
The day after tomorrow is the tea party.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.600
I invited Gu Jinzhao.

34:04.680 --> 34:06.030
Why did you invite her?

34:06.110 --> 34:07.910
Do you have nothing better to do?

34:08.360 --> 34:10.320
She is also the wife of a Grand Secretary.

34:10.320 --> 34:12.780
Isn't it right
to invite her to the tea party?

34:13.000 --> 34:13.550
Did something

34:13.550 --> 34:14.630
upset you,

34:14.960 --> 34:16.800
and you came here to take it out on me?

34:16.800 --> 34:18.960
What else could upset me?

34:19.630 --> 34:20.550
Isn't this all because of

34:20.550 --> 34:21.880
your terrible idea?

34:25.000 --> 34:26.070
Alright. All...

34:26.070 --> 34:27.070
All of you, leave.

34:37.510 --> 34:38.960
You told me to incite those scholars

34:38.960 --> 34:40.440
to stop Third Mr. Chen's carriage

34:40.440 --> 34:41.920
and protest the unfair land reform.

34:41.920 --> 34:42.630
And what happened?

34:42.630 --> 34:43.440
Now I've gotten myself

34:43.440 --> 34:44.320
caught up in it.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.980
Third Mr. Chen knows about it?

34:47.110 --> 34:49.310
There's nothing to fear even if he does.

34:49.360 --> 34:49.960
Those scholars

34:49.960 --> 34:51.620
were right in the first place.

34:52.070 --> 34:54.440
The land reform is indeed unfair.

34:54.670 --> 34:56.630
You know nothing!

34:56.960 --> 34:58.030
Do you know what those scholars

34:58.030 --> 34:59.630
are shouting as slogans now?

34:59.880 --> 35:01.590
"Clear the imperial estates

35:02.000 --> 35:04.190
and inventory
His Majesty's private properties."

35:04.190 --> 35:04.880
I told them

35:04.880 --> 35:06.320
to protest against the unfair land reform.

35:06.320 --> 35:07.000
I didn't tell them

35:07.000 --> 35:08.880
to clear His Majesty's land.

35:09.670 --> 35:11.280
So you got scolded by Fu Hailian.

35:11.280 --> 35:12.480
What else could it be?

35:13.230 --> 35:13.920
In front of Third Mr. Chen,

35:13.920 --> 35:15.380
he scolded me harshly.

35:15.960 --> 35:16.880
And look at you.

35:17.190 --> 35:18.790
You even invited Gu Jinzhao.

35:19.000 --> 35:20.400
Aren't you embarrassed?

35:21.360 --> 35:22.960
Why should I be embarrassed?

35:23.050 --> 35:24.980
You are the embarrassed one, okay?

35:26.280 --> 35:27.370
Since this time

35:27.510 --> 35:29.570
you suffered a loss to Third Mr. Chen,

35:29.800 --> 35:32.270
I have even more reason
to invite Gu Jinzhao.

35:32.400 --> 35:32.880
What?

35:39.230 --> 35:41.620
[Where Spring Caresses Jade]

35:49.950 --> 35:51.880
Do you really want to go that badly?

35:51.920 --> 35:53.400
You noticed it?

35:58.030 --> 36:00.160
I'm afraid they'll play tricks on you.

36:01.440 --> 36:02.890
I'm not easy to bully.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.110
True.

36:05.590 --> 36:06.680
I'm more afraid

36:07.150 --> 36:08.750
that you'll clash with them.

36:08.920 --> 36:09.630
What's wrong?

36:09.630 --> 36:11.630
Are you afraid you can't protect me?

36:14.350 --> 36:15.550
Trying to provoke me?

36:16.000 --> 36:17.800
As a dignified Grand Secretary,

36:17.800 --> 36:19.330
although I lack seniority,

36:19.630 --> 36:21.890
I am more than capable of protecting you.

36:22.630 --> 36:23.890
That's fine then.

36:25.190 --> 36:26.810
I want to attend the tea party

36:26.920 --> 36:28.360
not for my own amusement.

36:29.000 --> 36:29.630
It's because

36:29.630 --> 36:31.840
it's the Grand Secretaries' wives'
tea party.

36:31.840 --> 36:33.150
If I don't go,

36:33.400 --> 36:36.130
wouldn't I be
isolating myself from this circle?

36:36.360 --> 36:38.290
That would also bring shame to you.

36:39.510 --> 36:40.400
I know.

36:42.230 --> 36:43.630
These Grand Secretaries' wives

36:43.630 --> 36:45.160
are all more senior than me.

36:45.670 --> 36:46.860
Even Madam Shen

36:47.000 --> 36:48.760
comes from a prestigious family

36:48.760 --> 36:50.760
with a profound family background.

36:50.920 --> 36:51.760
Don't worry.

36:51.760 --> 36:53.320
I won't offend them.

36:54.920 --> 36:55.590
Alright.

36:56.630 --> 36:58.920
Then I'll ask around for you

36:59.440 --> 37:01.150
about these Grand Secretaries' wives'

37:01.150 --> 37:02.440
personalities

37:02.840 --> 37:04.030
and preferences.

37:04.920 --> 37:06.510
Where are you going to ask?

37:06.670 --> 37:08.930
They are all noble ladies in the capital.

37:09.110 --> 37:10.440
If people find out,

37:10.800 --> 37:12.930
they'll laugh at you behind your back.

37:13.150 --> 37:14.320
I have my own ways.

38:00.190 --> 38:01.840
Madam Chen, this way please.

38:04.080 --> 38:05.710
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

38:11.360 --> 38:12.280
Madam Fu.

38:14.070 --> 38:15.070
Madam Wang.

38:17.800 --> 38:18.550
Madam Yao.

38:19.280 --> 38:20.150
Madam He.

38:21.250 --> 38:24.530
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

38:21.510 --> 38:22.880
Greetings, Madams.

38:47.960 --> 38:49.300
Greetings, Madam Chen.

38:49.510 --> 38:50.570
Please take a seat.

38:51.900 --> 38:55.760
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

38:52.800 --> 38:53.690
Miss Qingpu,

38:54.260 --> 38:56.190
please follow me to rest over here.

39:09.510 --> 39:10.760
Look at the new bride.

39:11.400 --> 39:12.960
She's so plain,

39:13.070 --> 39:14.360
yet very beautiful.

39:14.840 --> 39:16.530
Her skin is so dewy.

39:16.670 --> 39:18.070
It is so good to be young.

39:18.550 --> 39:19.970
You flatter me, Madam He.

39:20.110 --> 39:21.170
I don't deserve it.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.510
In terms of looks,

39:23.000 --> 39:24.150
all of you ladies

39:24.320 --> 39:25.740
are much more magnificent.

39:25.740 --> 39:28.970
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

39:26.230 --> 39:27.070
I was just

39:27.230 --> 39:28.800
born a little later.

39:31.440 --> 39:32.070
By the way.

39:32.670 --> 39:33.360
Today

39:33.510 --> 39:35.370
is my first time at this tea party.

39:35.550 --> 39:36.760
I prepared gifts

39:37.000 --> 39:38.060
for all the ladies.

39:40.150 --> 39:41.550
Please, no gifts.

39:42.110 --> 39:43.400
This is a tea party,

39:43.880 --> 39:44.590
not a place outside

39:44.590 --> 39:46.360
to curry favor or do business.

39:47.360 --> 39:49.560
The husbands of those of us sitting here

39:49.670 --> 39:51.190
are either Grand Secretaries

39:51.190 --> 39:53.360
or high officials of the Imperial Court.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.000
We ourselves

39:54.000 --> 39:55.880
also hold imperial titles.

39:56.150 --> 39:57.950
If we give each other gifts

39:58.000 --> 39:59.070
and word gets out,

39:59.280 --> 40:01.400
at best we'll be a laughingstock,

40:01.760 --> 40:04.620
and at worst,
we'll give people an excuse to gossip.

40:06.070 --> 40:07.930
When Madam Fu first set this rule,

40:08.320 --> 40:10.190
I thought she was overthinking it.

40:10.190 --> 40:11.190
I didn't expect

40:11.400 --> 40:13.360
someone to actually bring gifts.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.860
It was presumptuous of me.

40:17.110 --> 40:19.360
This is my first time
attending this tea party.

40:19.360 --> 40:21.400
I thought one couldn't go wrong
with being too polite.

40:21.400 --> 40:22.480
I didn't know the tea party

40:22.480 --> 40:23.570
had such rules.

40:24.000 --> 40:24.930
I'm to blame too.

40:25.440 --> 40:27.190
I started preparing gifts

40:27.320 --> 40:28.920
right after receiving
Madam Wang's invitation.

40:28.920 --> 40:29.580
I should

40:29.670 --> 40:31.530
have consulted Madam Wang first.

40:34.360 --> 40:36.290
Since you sent her the invitation,

40:37.320 --> 40:39.580
you should have given her some pointers.

40:40.710 --> 40:41.360
Yes.

40:42.030 --> 40:43.320
I overlooked it.

40:45.630 --> 40:47.050
Is everyone here?

40:47.210 --> 40:54.940
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

40:47.360 --> 40:47.840
Yes.

40:48.400 --> 40:49.840
The garden is ready.

40:49.960 --> 40:51.360
Let's all go together.

41:01.190 --> 41:02.190
It doesn't matter.

41:02.190 --> 41:02.920
Don't worry.

41:05.310 --> 41:09.100
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

41:13.510 --> 41:14.510
I heard

41:14.840 --> 41:16.960
the Left Vice Minister
of Rites position is vacant.

41:16.960 --> 41:18.070
There have been 2 rounds of recommendation
in the court,

41:18.070 --> 41:19.400
but no one was selected.

41:21.190 --> 41:22.320
If you ask me,

41:23.510 --> 41:25.880
Lord Zeng Ruoyu

41:26.110 --> 41:27.320
is prudent.

41:27.760 --> 41:29.710
He is also a famous scholar,

41:30.030 --> 41:31.560
perfect for this position.

41:32.320 --> 41:33.360
Madam Yao,

41:33.800 --> 41:34.800
what do you think?

41:38.360 --> 41:39.440
My husband

41:39.510 --> 41:41.570
has praised Lord Zeng several times.

41:42.400 --> 41:43.860
For this recommendation,

41:44.440 --> 41:46.570
he will probably recommend Lord Zeng.

41:47.630 --> 41:48.510
That's good.

41:51.320 --> 41:52.590
My husband said

41:53.230 --> 41:56.510
the Hall of Literary Profundity
is short of several drafters.

41:56.510 --> 41:58.640
I remember you have a nephew who became

41:58.760 --> 42:01.280
a palace graduate
in the 35th year of Jingning.

42:01.280 --> 42:02.810
Why not let him give it a try?

42:04.630 --> 42:06.320
Then on behalf of my nephew,

42:06.320 --> 42:07.150
I thank you.

42:13.320 --> 42:14.190
Madam Shen?

42:17.150 --> 42:17.840
You seem a bit

42:17.840 --> 42:19.320
absent-minded today.

42:20.960 --> 42:21.590
Madam.

42:25.110 --> 42:25.670
You know

42:25.670 --> 42:27.110
my husband's temper.

42:27.280 --> 42:28.740
It comes and goes quickly.

42:29.280 --> 42:30.880
Go back and tell Keqian

42:31.230 --> 42:32.590
not to worry too much.

42:32.960 --> 42:34.610
He only gets angry like this

42:34.800 --> 42:35.960
at people he trusts.

42:36.510 --> 42:37.320
I see.

42:37.550 --> 42:38.550
Thank you, Madam.

42:44.920 --> 42:46.070
-Let go of me!
-Let go of me!

42:46.070 --> 42:47.530
-Let go of me!
-Let go of me!

42:47.590 --> 42:48.980
-I'm an Imperial Court official!
-Let go of me!

42:48.980 --> 42:51.280
-Do you have any respect for the law?
-Let go of me!

42:51.280 --> 42:52.360
Let me go!

42:53.800 --> 42:54.920
Commander,

42:55.110 --> 42:56.710
at the inn in the west of the city,

42:56.710 --> 42:58.370
I captured An Deyu and his wife

42:58.440 --> 42:59.690
and found a seal.

43:00.630 --> 43:01.710
Please take a look.

43:02.440 --> 43:03.500
An arrest warrant?

43:03.880 --> 43:05.480
The Three Judiciary Offices
are still investigating.

43:05.480 --> 43:07.540
How could His Majesty issue an edict?

43:17.880 --> 43:18.670
Ye Xian!

43:18.960 --> 43:21.220
Investigating Censor of the Censorate,

43:21.590 --> 43:22.410
An Deyu,

43:22.550 --> 43:25.150
sold government posts, neglected
his duties, and corrupted the law.

43:25.150 --> 43:26.280
By imperial decree,

43:26.630 --> 43:28.430
take him to the imperial prison.

43:28.920 --> 43:29.800
Nonsense!

43:30.230 --> 43:31.700
You are framing me!

43:32.510 --> 43:33.190
Master!

43:47.160 --> 43:50.970
[A Splendid Match]
